            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jackie C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't make them as a shot, but made a bunch in a pitcher as a Thanksgiving \"dessert\" even though I think we finished them off before dinner...very smooth. No matter how hard I tried I couldn't layer them so I gave up and just mixed it."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "RubyRind9879"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Make mine a double, stirred, over cracked ice!",
            "datePublished": "2024-10-01T02:04:58.822Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SappyTofu9042"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It's no wonder people couldn't layer it. The recipe gives the WRONG order of addition of the ingredients. No mention of temperature or use of ice. Cream is always less dense so it floats. It makes no sense to add it in the middle and triple sec at the end. Cream should be the last one to be added, very gently, to stay on top.",
            "datePublished": "2023-12-14T05:54:25.307Z"
          }
